---
const marquee = [
  'TypeScript',
  'Astro',
  'Design systems',
  'Blender',
  'three.js',
  'Figma',
  'Obsidian API',
  'Illustration',
  'Motion',
  'Hard-surface modelling',
];
---

<!-- Duplicated once so the GSAP loop can translate -50% and wrap seamlessly. -->
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee__track" data-marquee-track>
    {
      [0, 1].map(() =>
        marquee.map((word) => (
          <span class="marquee__item">
            {word}
            <span class="marquee__sep">✦</span>
          </span>
        )),
      )
    }
  </div>
</div>

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="shell about__grid">
    <div class="about__sticky">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>About</p>
      <h2 class="about__title" data-split>Designer, then engineer</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about__prose">
      <p data-reveal>
        I am <strong>Thales Medeiros</strong>. For most of the last decade my
        job was to decide how something should look and behave, write it down,
        and hand it to someone else to build. I got good at the deciding part.
        The handing-off part never stopped bothering me.
      </p>

      <p data-reveal>
        So I learned to build. I started with the software I use every day —
        Obsidian — and shipped five plugins in as many months: a contextual
        menu, a dictionary manager, a favourites tab, a frontmatter tag
        injector, and a text expander. Small tools, but real ones, with real
        users filing real issues.
      </p>

      <p data-reveal>
        What surprised me is how little of the design work I had to leave
        behind. Naming things well is the same skill as naming a layer well.
        Deciding what a plugin should <em>refuse</em> to do is scoping. The
        difference is that now I can close the loop myself.
      </p>

      <p data-reveal>
        I still draw birds and model handhelds. That is not a hobby I keep
        separate from the engineering — it is where the taste comes from.
      </p>

      <div class="about__now" data-reveal>
        <p class="about__now-label">Currently</p>
        <ul class="about__now-list">
          <li>Deepening TypeScript and front-end architecture</li>
          <li>Maintaining five Obsidian plugins</li>
          <li>Open to design engineering roles and commissions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .marquee {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    /* Guarantees the duplicated track is always wider than the viewport. */
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .marquee__track {
    display: inline-flex;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .marquee__item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-right: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .marquee__sep {
    font-size: 0.5em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about__sticky {
      position: sticky;
      top: 8rem;
    }
  }

  .about__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about__prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .about__prose strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about__prose em {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about__now {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface-raised);
  }

  .about__now-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about__now-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .about__now-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about__now-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    color: var(--text-faint);
    flex: none;
  }
</style>
